entity   Agent
process  Clone  Ensure repo cloned
process  Modify Modify file
process  Commit Commit changes
process  Push   Push to remote
store    Config
store    Remote  Remote


Agent  --> Clone   file, contents, msg
Config --> Clone   repo url, dir, msg
Remote --> Clone   repo
Clone  --> Modify  dir, file, contents, msg
Modify --> Commit  dir, msg
Commit --> Push dir
Push   --> Remote
